Narāntaka slain enrages Dēvāntaka Triśiras Mahōdara --- Mahōdara rides elephant while Dēvāntaka takes mace Triśiras chariot --- Three demons beset Aṅgada with darts mace shafts --- Aṅgada unshaken tears tusks of elephant batters Dēvāntaka --- Dēvāntaka revives fells Aṅgada Triśiras shafts brow --- Hanumān Nīla hasten to rescue Triśiras shatters Nīla peak --- Hanumān fells Dēvāntaka with thunderlike fist to head --- Nīla hurls wooded peak crushes Mahōdara with elephant --- Hanumān breaks spear sword then beheads three crowned Triśiras --- R̥ṣabha seizes mace of Mahāpārśva crushes him to earth --- Leaderless demon host drops weapons flees like broken sea